    { "dot": "rose", "title": "Production boundary", "items": ["Control-plane authority: docs/CONTROL_PLANE_CONTRACT.md:32–67 — only POP Executor and deploy.yml may execute production changes.", "Exact-main and successful-CI checks immediately precede the executor: .github/workflows/deploy.yml:664–689."] },
